  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 716.08 Enhanced Filtration and Disinfection Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 716.08 Enhanced Filtration and Disinfection Requirements. The O/O of a PWS subject to this part shall comply with the enhanced filtration and disinfection requirements of:\n\n(a) 40 CFR 141 Subpart P, §§170-175, if the PWS serves 10,000 persons or more; or\n\n(b) 40 CFR 141 Subpart T, §§500-571, if the PWS serves fewer than 10,000 persons.\n\nSource. #9620, eff 1-1-10; ss by #12533, eff 6-1-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
